# TIP-054.4b-R27 consolidated verification

2026-10-11 · Contractor/Main · **LOCAL PRE stage G1–G5 accepted 5/5; full R27 PARTIAL / NOT_READY.**

Human approved stage-specific synthetic-input implementation and local tests.
The original full corruption control now completes through the real owned writer,
instead of merely demonstrating the preceding diagnostic rejection. This closes
a local source-integration gap, not the failed executor latency qualification.
Vibecode separation kept implementation with Builder and verification with Main
and an independent source Reviewer. No new micro-TIP or campaign was introduced.

R21 SLA FAILED/P1, EXE-009 OPEN/P1, serving candidate NOT_READY, executor OFF and
TIP-054.5 BLOCKED remain. SQL/Docker, external processing, campaign, rebuild,
Git writes and activation were not performed.

